      {
        "action_date": "2025-11-07",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Bureau of Prisons Pay Protection Act</strong></p><p>This bill provides appropriations for the salaries of Bureau of Prisons (BOP) personnel during any lapse in discretionary appropriations for any fiscal year (i.e., a government shutdown).&nbsp;During a lapse in appropriations, the bill provides appropriations for the salaries of correctional and non-correctional personnel at BOP facilities.&nbsp;</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-11-19T13:12:10Z"
      }
    ]
